{| class="wikitable"
|+
!Item
!Iridium Cost
!Description
|-
|[[File:item_3327.png|link=]] [[Token of Reclamation]]
|[[File:Iridium_18x18.png|link=]] 100
|Each token will allow you to recover one destroyed item from the destroyed item list by visiting a merchant and using the recovery tab.  NOTE: Items recovered through Tokens of Reclaimation are attuned to your character, are no longer tradeable and lose all in-game sell value.  This Token cannot be traded and is bound to the character you purchased it on.
|-
